{
    "title": "Grimguard Tactics: Fantasy RPG",
    "description": "Grimguard Tactics is an epic, dark fantasy RPG strategy game with an expansive Hero summon and simple easy to learn turn-based tactics gameplay.\r\n\r\nThe Primorva, an ancient evil has awoken from the shadows. To free the world of Terenos you must summon and bring together its most powerful, legendary, and dangerous heroes in attempt to drive back the oncoming darkness. In battle you'll forge unlikely alliances and assemble an epic team of the greatest heroes this world has ever seen! \r\n\r\nDownload Grimguard Tactics: Fantasy RPG now to join the epic fight and free Terenos! \r\n\r\n*FEATURES* \r\n\r\nSTRATEGY TACTICS RPG \r\nFeaturing turn-based RPG tactics gameplay with strategy that is easy to play, but tough to master. Command a team of epic heroes using devastating RPG style combos and powerful tactics to change the tides of combat! \r\n\r\nPVP ARENA\r\nMark your place in history, by battling it out with players from around the world. Climb to the top of the leaderboard and reap the rewards just waiting to taken!\r\n\r\nEPIC HERO COLLECTOR \r\nRecruit the most epic of heroes with unique perks, abilities, factions, and bonus stats through the Hero Recruitment Caravan. Upgrade Gear, Level Up and then Ascend your Heroes to raid enemies and take part in the epic war against the evil Primorvan hoard in this dark fantasy RPG! \r\n\r\nTEAM CUSTOMIZATION \r\nCustomize your team with epic Heroes from different RPG roles such as Assault, Tank, and Support and create the perfect epic hero squad! As you battle and raid the enemy, experiment to discover the powerful hidden synergistic combinations that provide your heroes with epic tactical bonuses.\r\n\r\nTACTICAL BOSS BATTLES \r\nEncounter epic tactical turn-based team Boss fights, challenging Dungeon raids, and even nightmarish corrupted Heroes that stand in your way. Put all your RPG strategy and tactics skills to the test to vanquish your epic foes and free Terenos! \r\n\r\nTOWN BUILDING \r\nGather your team and embark on epic raids into the Primorvan controlled empires and enemy camps. You'll obtain many resources from these raids and battles, which you can then use to rebuild and upgrade Holdfast, the last free bastion of humanity. \r\n\r\nQUICK IDLE AFK AUTOPLAY \r\nIf you're busy or your raid team is feeling weary, feel free to go AFK and play idle with autoplay! It's your choice, either use turn-based tactics to play your battles with skill and strategy or take it easy and raid hands free AFK idle style in this dark fantasy tactics RPG strategy game! \r\n\r\nStory thus far- \r\n\r\nThe evil Primorva were the first creatures to inhabit the free lands of Terenos, and the first embodiments of life\u2019s basest cravings; hunger, lust, and pain. Like epic nightmares of dark fantasy fleeing from the dawn, they were driven into the shadows by the powerful Dawnseekers, a legendary squad of Heroes established to fight and defeat Primorva wherever they show up. \r\n\r\nNow this epic dark force has managed to escape from their exile in the Umbral Plane; they have evolved far beyond the whispered legends of \u2018beasties and boogeymen\u2019 that were once told by parents to scare their children. In an unthinkable fantasy, the Primorvan forces learned to corrupt the free folk with their loathsome tactics, trading being free for unlimited power.\r\n\r\nThis is an invasion of unutterable terror and unthinkable insanity. Humanity isn\u2019t just being conquered, it is being plunged into an epic nightmare from which it may never awaken. \r\n\r\n* Network connection is required to play Grimguard Tactics: Fantasy RPG. \r\n* Grimguard Tactics: Fantasy RPG is free to download and play, some items are available for in game purchasing for real money. \r\n\r\nHelp & Support Email: gg-support@outerdawn.com \r\nPrivacy Policy: https://www.outerdawn.com/privacypolicy/en \r\nFacebook: facebook.com/grimguardtactics \r\nX (Twitter): GrimguardGame  \r\nInstagram: grimguardtactics",
    "descriptionHTML": "Grimguard Tactics is an epic, dark fantasy RPG strategy game with an expansive Hero summon and simple easy to learn turn-based tactics gameplay.<br><br>The Primorva, an ancient evil has awoken from the shadows. To free the world of Terenos you must summon and bring together its most powerful, legendary, and dangerous heroes in attempt to drive back the oncoming darkness. In battle you&#39;ll forge unlikely alliances and assemble an epic team of the greatest heroes this world has ever seen! <br><br>Download Grimguard Tactics: Fantasy RPG now to join the epic fight and free Terenos! <br><br>*FEATURES* <br><br>STRATEGY TACTICS RPG <br>Featuring turn-based RPG tactics gameplay with strategy that is easy to play, but tough to master. Command a team of epic heroes using devastating RPG style combos and powerful tactics to change the tides of combat! <br><br>PVP ARENA<br>Mark your place in history, by battling it out with players from around the world. Climb to the top of the leaderboard and reap the rewards just waiting to taken!<br><br>EPIC HERO COLLECTOR <br>Recruit the most epic of heroes with unique perks, abilities, factions, and bonus stats through the Hero Recruitment Caravan. Upgrade Gear, Level Up and then Ascend your Heroes to raid enemies and take part in the epic war against the evil Primorvan hoard in this dark fantasy RPG! <br><br>TEAM CUSTOMIZATION <br>Customize your team with epic Heroes from different RPG roles such as Assault, Tank, and Support and create the perfect epic hero squad! As you battle and raid the enemy, experiment to discover the powerful hidden synergistic combinations that provide your heroes with epic tactical bonuses.<br><br>TACTICAL BOSS BATTLES <br>Encounter epic tactical turn-based team Boss fights, challenging Dungeon raids, and even nightmarish corrupted Heroes that stand in your way. Put all your RPG strategy and tactics skills to the test to vanquish your epic foes and free Terenos! <br><br>TOWN BUILDING <br>Gather your team and embark on epic raids into the Primorvan controlled empires and enemy camps. You&#39;ll obtain many resources from these raids and battles, which you can then use to rebuild and upgrade Holdfast, the last free bastion of humanity. <br><br>QUICK IDLE AFK AUTOPLAY <br>If you&#39;re busy or your raid team is feeling weary, feel free to go AFK and play idle with autoplay! It&#39;s your choice, either use turn-based tactics to play your battles with skill and strategy or take it easy and raid hands free AFK idle style in this dark fantasy tactics RPG strategy game! <br><br>Story thus far- <br><br>The evil Primorva were the first creatures to inhabit the free lands of Terenos, and the first embodiments of life\u2019s basest cravings; hunger, lust, and pain. Like epic nightmares of dark fantasy fleeing from the dawn, they were driven into the shadows by the powerful Dawnseekers, a legendary squad of Heroes established to fight and defeat Primorva wherever they show up. <br><br>Now this epic dark force has managed to escape from their exile in the Umbral Plane; they have evolved far beyond the whispered legends of \u2018beasties and boogeymen\u2019 that were once told by parents to scare their children. In an unthinkable fantasy, the Primorvan forces learned to corrupt the free folk with their loathsome tactics, trading being free for unlimited power.<br><br>This is an invasion of unutterable terror and unthinkable insanity. Humanity isn\u2019t just being conquered, it is being plunged into an epic nightmare from which it may never awaken. <br><br>* Network connection is required to play Grimguard Tactics: Fantasy RPG. <br>* Grimguard Tactics: Fantasy RPG is free to download and play, some items are available for in game purchasing for real money. <br><br>Help &amp; Support Email: gg-support@outerdawn.com <br>Privacy Policy: https://www.outerdawn.com/privacypolicy/en <br>Facebook: facebook.com/grimguardtactics <br>X (Twitter): GrimguardGame  <br>Instagram: grimguardtactics",
